  "claim": "The driver Marlon Stöckinger has been in less races than MatthieuVaxivière.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Matthieu Vaxivière. Sentence: He was the 2011 French F4 champion.\nPage: Matthieu Vaxivière. Sentence: In 2012 he raced in the V de V Endurance Cup, French GT, and 2e Grand Prix Èlectrique.\nPage: Matthieu Vaxivière. Sentence: In addition, he was 14th in the 2012 Formula Renault 2.0 Alps season and 29th in the Formula Renault 2.0 Eurocup, driving for Tech 1 Racing.\nPage: Matthieu Vaxivière. Sentence: In 2013 he finished 10th in the Formula Renault 2.0 Eurocup and 18th in the Formula Renault 2.0 Alps.\nPage: Matthieu Vaxivière. Sentence: In 2014 he was assigned as one of the drivers for the Lotus F1 Junior team, while competing in the Formula Renault 3.5 series alongside Filipino-Swiss driver Marlon Stöckinger.\nPage: Marlon Stöckinger. Sentence: Marlon Alexander Stöckinger (born 4 April 1991 in Manila) is a Filipino racing driver, who raced for Status Grand Prix in the 2012 GP3 Series and currently driving for Lotus F1 Team Juniors in the 2013 World Series by Renault.",
  "evidence_text": "Page: Matthieu Vaxivière. Sentence: He was the 2011 French F4 champion.\nPage: Matthieu Vaxivière. Sentence: In 2012 he raced in the V de V Endurance Cup, French GT, and 2e Grand Prix Èlectrique.\nPage: Matthieu Vaxivière. Sentence: In addition, he was 14th in the 2012 Formula Renault 2.0 Alps season and 29th in the Formula Renault 2.0 Eurocup, driving for Tech 1 Racing.\nPage: Matthieu Vaxivière. Sentence: In 2013 he finished 10th in the Formula Renault 2.0 Eurocup and 18th in the Formula Renault 2.0 Alps.\nPage: Matthieu Vaxivière. Sentence: In 2014 he was assigned as one of the drivers for the Lotus F1 Junior team, while competing in the Formula Renault 3.5 series alongside Filipino-Swiss driver Marlon Stöckinger.\nPage: Marlon Stöckinger. Sentence: Marlon Alexander Stöckinger (born 4 April 1991 in Manila) is a Filipino racing driver, who raced for Status Grand Prix in the 2012 GP3 Series and currently driving for Lotus F1 Team Juniors in the 2013 World Series by Renault.",
